      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note",
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## 3d/shot-to-prop\n\nDCC guide still -> textured TRELLIS.2 prop mesh, so a hero object in a finished shot becomes an asset you can re-composite into other shots.\n\nSource: `EZDCCLoadGuideStill` (slug `go-see`, shot `12`, layer `first`). The preview node draws the guide layer you are turning into geometry before the queue spends GPU.\n\nUNET: `trellis_2_int8_convrot.safetensors`. CLIP vision: `dino_v3_vit_l.safetensors` (DINOv3 license, opt-in pack). Structure decode stays at 32.\n\nUpsample `target_resolution` is an int and ComfyUI only accepts 1024-2048 in steps of 128; this graph runs the 1024 floor.\n\nSaveGLB writes the mesh to `output/assets/objects/_lab-shot-prop/prop_NNNNN_.glb` - MeshToFile3D only converts in memory. Do not mint an Asset Bible row from this graph.\n\nDINOv3 is Meta's custom commercial-friendly license - not Apache. MIT TRELLIS weights without DINOv3 cannot Queue.\n\nOccupancy: trellis - stop Blender desk, LTX, Wan, Klein denoise. One GB10 job.\n"
      ],
      "title": "Operator note"
    },
