  "extra": {
    "lab_note": "## 3d/shot-to-prop\n\nDCC guide still -> textured TRELLIS.2 prop mesh, so a hero object in a finished shot becomes an asset you can re-composite into other shots.\n\nSource: `EZDCCLoadGuideStill` (slug `go-see`, shot `12`, layer `first`). The preview node draws the guide layer you are turning into geometry before the queue spends GPU.\n\nUNET: `trellis_2_int8_convrot.safetensors`. CLIP vision: `dino_v3_vit_l.safetensors` (DINOv3 license, opt-in pack). Structure decode stays at 32.\n\nUpsample `target_resolution` is an int and ComfyUI only accepts 1024-2048 in steps of 128; this graph runs the 1024 floor.\n\nSaveGLB writes the mesh to `output/assets/objects/_lab-shot-prop/prop_NNNNN_.glb` - MeshToFile3D only converts in memory. Do not mint an Asset Bible row from this graph.\n\nDINOv3 is Meta's custom commercial-friendly license - not Apache. MIT TRELLIS weights without DINOv3 cannot Queue.\n\nOccupancy: trellis - stop Blender desk, LTX, Wan, Klein denoise. One GB10 job.\n",
    "lab_profile": "3d/shot-to-prop",
    "lab_description": "Guide still of a shot to textured TRELLIS.2 prop mesh. Upsample 1024.",
    "lab_trellis": {
      "unet": "trellis_2_int8_convrot.safetensors",
      "resolution": 1024,
      "stages": [
        "structure",
        "shape",
        "upsample",
        "texture"
      ],
      "textured": true,
      "batch_size": 1,
      "save_prefix": "assets/objects/_lab-shot-prop/prop",
      "native_only": true
    },
    "lab_app_mode": {
      "enabled": true,
      "default_view": "app",
      "frontend_min": "1.41.13",
      "lane": "3d",
      "occupancy": "trellis",
      "enhance_off_identity": true,
      "handoff": [
        "3d/prop-variants"
      ]
    },
    "linearData": {
      "inputs": [
        [
          25,
          "quality",
          {
            "label": "Detail",
            "description": "draft is a quick look. standard is what this App ships tuned for. final is the best this App's own stack can do. A rung never changes size and never leaves this App's model stack. The caption names the steps, CFG, weights, and license Queue actually sends."
          }
        ],
        [
          2,
          "slug",
          {
            "label": "Shot pack",
            "description": "Which DCC shot pack the guide still comes out of. Set it with Shot id below, then check the preview before you Queue."
          }
        ],
        [
          2,
          "shot_id",
          {
            "label": "Shot id",
            "description": "Shot whose hero object becomes the prop. The guide still of this shot is what TRELLIS.2 conditions on."
          }
        ],
        [
          2,
          "layer",
          {
            "label": "Guide layer",
            "description": "Which guide layer of the shot becomes the prop. The preview node draws this same layer before the queue spends GPU."
          }
        ],
        [
          16,
          "target_resolution",
          {
            "label": "Upsample resolution",
            "description": "Structure resolution the refined shape stage renders at. ComfyUI accepts only 1024-2048 in steps of 128; 1024 is the floor and the lab default."
          }
        ],
        [
          20,
          "steps",
          {
            "label": "Texture pass",
            "description": "Steps on the texture sampler. 12 is the authored pass; 4-6 is a paint draft before you commit the full pass. The mesh geometry does not change."
          }
        ],
        [
          24,
          "filename_prefix",
          {
            "label": "Save prefix",
            "description": "Output stem under the ComfyUI output folder. Keep the assets/objects/_lab-... convention so the mesh lands in the one tree the catalog and the Blender exporter walk."
          }
        ]
      ],
      "outputs": [
        24
      ]
    },
    "linearMode": true,
    "lab_quality": {
      "default": "standard"
    },
    "lab_rel": "3d/shot-to-prop",
    "workflowRendererVersion": "Vue-corrected"
  },
  "version": 0.4
